OL,3,AStorm Boelo leaves 22,000 without power
OL,4,Aas Met Office issues new wind warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow warning for strong winds came
OL,7,Fin effect at 18:00 on Monday across the
OL,8,Fwest coast of England, Wales and
OL,9,FScotland and eastern parts of Northern
OL,10,FIreland and will last until 03:00 on
OL,11,FTuesday.
